cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GeoProfilerX in your research, please cite it using these metadata."

title: "GeoProfilerX: A Python Tool for Extracting Line and Swath Profiles from Projected Raster Datasets"

abstract: "GeoProfilerX is an open-source Python tool for extracting line and swath profiles from projected single-band raster datasets using LineString and MultiLineString vector geometries. It is designed for topographic, geophysical, remote sensing, environmental, and other geospatial applications."

authors:
